# --- IDA / disassembly exports (regenerated, huge) ---
.ida-exports/*

# --- Build trees ---
build/*

# --- Oversized generated reference data (regenerated, not committed) ---
**/DecFIGS_Burnout_Internal_PS3.ELF.lineinfo.json
**/decfigs_inlining.json
IDA Files/Burnout_External_PS3.ELF.i64
IDA Files/BurnoutPR.exe.i64
IDA Files/*.xex
IDA Files/Spore*
IDA Files/ProStreet*
# Unpacked IDA database components -- transient, left behind by headless idat runs
